WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:06.200
Enough! Zhen granted you so much time, yet you comprehended nothing!

00:06.360 --> 00:10.200
You possess neither talent nor ruthlessness—how could you possibly lead an expedition to the north?!

00:10.480 --> 00:14.600
Your elder brother can at least safeguard this half of our imperial realm.

00:14.800 --> 00:18.000
As for you? Honestly resigned yourself to being a carefree, powerless prince!

00:20.000 --> 00:30.500
"Chancellor Chen has commanded that the weeds must be uprooted entirely. Forgive us, Your Highness."
